      "title": "Trump tries to rally support for Republican candidates as top Super Pac for Senate Democrats pours millions into key races – live",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/live/2026/oct/14/donald-trump-us-midterms-arizona-montana-politics-latest-news-updates",
      "description": "<p>Trump in Arizona and Montana ahead of midterm elections; The Senate Majority Pac puts millions of dollars toward competitive races in Michigan and Maine</p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/news/2026/feb/17/sign-up-for-the-breaking-news-us-email-to-get-newsletter-alerts-direct-to-your-inbox?utm_medium=ACQUISITIONS_STANDFIRST&amp;utm_campaign=BN22326&amp;utm_content=signup&amp;utm_term=standfirst&amp;utm_source=GUARDIAN_WEB\">Sign up for the Breaking News US email</a></p></li></ul><p><strong>Donald Trump has yet to weigh in on the late night ruling from a federal judge that blocks him from barring CNN, MS Now and Politico access to the White House grounds.</strong></p><p>Previously, the president had blasted Judge Timothy Kelly – a Trump appointee – for issuing a temporary pause on his media ban. That expired on Tuesday, and Kelly <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/oct/14/white-house-media-ban-lifted-cnn-msnow-politico\">handed down a preliminary injunction</a> that stops the administration from blocking the outlets while the litigation plays out.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/live/2026/oct/14/donald-trump-us-midterms-arizona-montana-politics-latest-news-updates\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
      "published": "2026-10-15T02:02:10"
    },
